        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, we are subject to the anti-fraud provisions of the Investment Advisers Act and to applicable fiduciary duties derived from these provisions that apply to our relationships with the investment vehicles that we manage.",
        "start_character": 24951,
        "end_character": 25180
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Certain of our subsidiaries and the funds that we manage that operate in jurisdictions outside of the United States are licensed by or have obtained authorizations to operate in their respective jurisdictions outside of the United States, and as a result are regulated by various international regulators and subject to applicable regulation.",
        "start_character": 33004,
        "end_character": 33346
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Many jurisdictions in which we operate have laws and regulations relating to data privacy, cybersecurity and protection of personal information, including the General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”), a European Union (“EU”) regulation that imposes detailed requirements related to the collection, storage, and use of personal information related to people located in the EU (or which is processed in the context of EU operations) and places data protection obligations and restrictions on organizations, a similar framework in the United Kingdom (the “UK GDPR”), and various privacy laws applicable to individuals residing in the United States, including the California Consumer Privacy Act (the “CCPA”), as amended by the California Privacy Rights Act.",
        "start_character": 31935,
        "end_character": 32692
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Outside of the U.S., certain of our subsidiaries and the funds that we manage are subject to regulation in numerous jurisdictions, including the EU, the United Kingdom, Luxembourg, Cayman Islands, Hong Kong, Japan, Singapore and Abu Dhabi.",
        "start_character": 33758,
        "end_character": 33997
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "These processes allow us to implement a flexible yet disciplined investment strategy for the funds we manage and for our balance sheet.",
        "start_character": 7302,
        "end_character": 7437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a leading global investment manager in digital infrastructure, deploying and managing capital across the digital ecosystem, including data centers, cell towers, and fiber networks.",
        "start_character": 473,
        "end_character": 660
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have a compliance group supervised by our Chief Compliance Officer that monitors our compliance with the regulatory requirements to which we are subject and manages our compliance policies and procedures.",
        "start_character": 34334,
        "end_character": 34541
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We hold ourselves out as an investment management firm engaged primarily in deploying and managing capital in infrastructure assets, and we believe that we are not an investment company under the 40% test.",
        "start_character": 28412,
        "end_character": 28617
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate as a taxable C Corporation and conduct substantially all of our activities and hold substantially all of our assets and liabilities through our Operating Company.",
        "start_character": 1059,
        "end_character": 1232
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We recognize that our people are our most important asset, and we are focused on attracting, retaining, developing and advancing the best talent for DigitalBridge.",
        "start_character": 35789,
        "end_character": 35952
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "and foreign jurisdictions in which we operate relating to, among other things, antitrust laws, anti-money laundering laws, anti-bribery laws relating to foreign officials, tax laws, foreign investment laws and privacy laws with respect to client and other information, and some of our funds invest in businesses that operate in highly regulated industries.",
        "start_character": 23727,
        "end_character": 24083
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001679688-26-000021",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001679688-26-000021-a843c06ec452e86c",
        "accession_number": "0001679688-26-000021",
